#
# omx-contract's contract directory (docs/contract-dir.md) for the spec of an owner that installs its own package of
# it: the schema major as this omx-contract reads it, and the directory a -contract subpackage's %files names,
#   %{omx_contract_dir}/<owner>/
# so no spec types the major a second time. Installed by omx-contract-devel; the same number is pkg-config's
# schema_major variable of omx-contract.pc.
%omx_contract_schema_major @SCHEMA_MAJOR@
%omx_contract_dir %{_datadir}/omx-contract/contract.d/%{omx_contract_schema_major}
